3	// Server actions for the native Nxeon Calendar + Tasks feature
4	// (/dashboard/calendar).
5	//
6	// Every action authenticates the caller (`requireUser`, via `resolveMailbox`),
7	// resolves ONLY a mailbox the caller owns, decrypts its stored credential, and
8	// talks to the customer's SOGo CalDAV over the mail server — reusing the SAME
9	// per-user mailbox credential the webmail client uses. Mutating actions are
10	// rate-limited and validate their input. The password never leaves the server.
11	//
